    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "F5E55EB69A7AFAB4",
      "text": "学校真是个\\n让人开心的地方呀～[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "F5E561B69A7AFFCD",
      "text": "波琵我\\n还没有去学校上过学。[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "F5E560B69A7AFE1A",
      "text": "所以教室和老师\\n全～都是第一次见，好兴奋呀～！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
