    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F72087BBC1885BB0",
      "text": "哼～！波琵我才没有\\n那么像小朋友呢！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_02b",
      "hash64": "74A27609DAB405D6",
      "text": "哎呀呀～！好厉害呀！\\n你是第一个猜中的人！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
