      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F72088BBC1885D63",
      "text": "波琵我今年９岁，\\n其实已经是可以去\\r\\n学院上学的年纪啦！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F7208DBBC18865E2",
      "text": "但我的宝可梦太强了，\\n会给大家添麻烦的……\\r\\n所以我就主动放弃了入学。[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "F7208EBBC1886795",
      "text": "然后也慈她就来\\n邀请我去当四天王……[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
